            "review_title": "Review at Pho Thin",
            "review_text": "jshtyo\nAichi Prefecture, Japan18825 contributions\n0\nSpeaking of Vietnam, it's Pho!\nNov 2024 • Couples\nWe stopped for lunch on the tour. The restaurant is full of 26 people so most of the tour is full, but it was well prepared and as soon as I entered the restaurant, I saw Pho. Speaking of pho, I have a taste for seasoning, but it was surprising because it didn't contain coriander. I thought about pho without Yabari coriander, but the seasoning was delicious and the soup was very good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten December 17, 2024",
